0..81 Comment "// The folds over a list of naturals — its length, appending and mapping — in"
82..157 Comment "// the spellings an arm admits, each as the sugared form writes it: a `run`"
158..235 Comment "// that only sequences a call, its result returned or the `return` elided, is"
236..314 Comment "// written with the call nested in the constructor, and a `run` written inside"
315..389 Comment "// a constructor\'s field stays. Each spelling of one fold runs to the same"
390..467 Comment "// value, and the polymorphic length of `recursive-lists.gandr` checks at the"
468..543 Comment "// naturals. A structural recursive call stands one stage below the list it"
544..602 Comment "// was read from (Abel, _Termination checking with types_,"
603..631 Comment "// doi:10.1051/ita:2004015)."
633..692 Comment "// The naturals, the numerals two and three, and the lists."
